r!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anna crawls over on all fours and tries to move the pieces of debris with shaking hands—they won't budge."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hang in there! The main force will be here any minute! We'll get you the best medic! You'll be fine!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alexander's face is coated in dust and blood, and his body spasms uncontrollably."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Alexander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm... feeling a bit cold... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Spring is almost over... Why is it still so cold..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Blood comes gushing out the moment he opens his mouth. Every breath he takes sounds like a pair of wheezing bellows."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't die. Stay alive..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anna."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Punch_Hit","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Go away! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Alexander, I'm ordering you to stay alive!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan"